"use strict";(self.webpackChunkwoocommerce_multivendor_marketplace_docs=self.webpackChunkwoocommerce_multivendor_marketplace_docs||[]).push([[8886],{67007(e,s,i){i.r(s),i.d(s,{comp:()=>o,data:()=>h});var l=i(20641);const n=i.p+"assets/img/all-news.f7427ea1.webp",a=i.p+"assets/img/settings.35b30203.webp",t=i.p+"assets/img/vendor-new.0a266120.webp",r={},o=(0,i(66262).A)(r,[["render",function(e,s){return(0,l.uX)(),(0,l.CE)("div",null,[...s[0]||(s[0]=[(0,l.Fv)('<h1 id="admin-news" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#admin-news"><span>Admin News</span></a></h1><p><a class="doc-image-link" href="./assets/all-news.webp"><img src="'+n+'" alt="All News List"></a></p><p>The <strong>Admin News</strong> feature allows the admin to create and publish news updates for vendors. Admins can also control the <strong>visibility of news for sellers</strong> based on marketplace requirements.</p><hr><h2 id="access-path" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#access-path"><span>Access Path</span></a></h2><ul><li><strong>Marketplace → Admin News</strong></li></ul><hr><h2 id="create-news" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#create-news"><span>Create News</span></a></h2><ul><li>Click on <strong>Add New News</strong> to create a new announcement.</li><li>Enter the required news details such as: <ul><li>News title</li><li>Description/content</li><li>Visibility options</li></ul></li></ul><p><a class="doc-image-link" href="./assets/settings.webp"><img src="'+a+'" alt="Admin News Settings"></a></p><ul><li>Click <strong>Publish</strong> to make the news live.</li><li>Admin can also <strong>edit previously published news</strong> at any time.</li></ul><hr><h2 id="news-visibility-options" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#news-visibility-options"><span>News Visibility Options</span></a></h2><p>While creating or editing news, the admin can control which sellers can see the announcement using the following options:</p><h3 id="show-news-to-sellers" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#show-news-to-sellers"><span>Show News to Sellers</span></a></h3><ul><li>When this option is enabled: <ul><li>The news is visible to <strong>all sellers</strong> in the marketplace.</li><li>Sellers can view the news from their <strong>Vendor Account Panel</strong>.</li></ul></li><li>Suitable for: <ul><li>General marketplace announcements</li><li>Policy updates</li><li>Feature releases</li><li>Maintenance notifications</li></ul></li></ul><hr><h3 id="hide-news-from-sellers" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#hide-news-from-sellers"><span>Hide News from Sellers</span></a></h3><ul><li>When this option is enabled: <ul><li>The news is <strong>hidden from sellers</strong>.</li><li>Only the admin can view the news in the admin panel.</li></ul></li><li>Useful for: <ul><li>Draft announcements</li><li>Internal testing</li><li>Temporarily disabling outdated or irrelevant news</li><li>Preparing announcements for future publishing</li></ul></li></ul><blockquote><p><strong>Note:</strong> The admin can toggle these options anytime by editing the news item.</p></blockquote><hr><h2 id="view-all-news" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#view-all-news"><span>View All News</span></a></h2><ul><li>Click on <strong>See All News</strong> to view the complete list of created news.</li><li>Displays: <ul><li>Active news</li><li>Hidden news</li><li>Previously published announcements</li></ul></li></ul><p><a class="doc-image-link" href="./assets/all-news.webp"><img src="'+n+'" alt="All News List"></a></p><hr><h2 id="vendor-visibility" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#vendor-visibility"><span>Vendor Visibility</span></a></h2><ul><li>Published and visible news appears in the vendor’s <strong>Vendor Account Panel</strong>.</li><li>Sellers can: <ul><li>View the announcement title</li><li>Read the full news content</li></ul></li></ul><p><a class="doc-image-link" href="./assets/vendor-new.webp"><img src="'+t+'" alt="Vendor News View"></a></p><hr><h2 id="use-cases" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#use-cases"><span>Use Cases</span></a></h2><ul><li>Marketplace-wide announcements</li><li>Vendor onboarding updates</li><li>Policy or commission changes</li><li>New feature releases</li><li>Scheduled maintenance notifications</li></ul><hr>',32)])])}]]),h=JSON.parse('{"path":"/documentation/admin-news.html","title":"Admin News","lang":"en-US","frontmatter":{},"headers":[{"level":2,"title":"Access Path","slug":"access-path","link":"#access-path","children":[]},{"level":2,"title":"Create News","slug":"create-news","link":"#create-news","children":[]},{"level":2,"title":"News Visibility Options","slug":"news-visibility-options","link":"#news-visibility-options","children":[{"level":3,"title":"Show News to Sellers","slug":"show-news-to-sellers","link":"#show-news-to-sellers","children":[]},{"level":3,"title":"Hide News from Sellers","slug":"hide-news-from-sellers","link":"#hide-news-from-sellers","children":[]}]},{"level":2,"title":"View All News","slug":"view-all-news","link":"#view-all-news","children":[]},{"level":2,"title":"Vendor Visibility","slug":"vendor-visibility","link":"#vendor-visibility","children":[]},{"level":2,"title":"Use Cases","slug":"use-cases","link":"#use-cases","children":[]}],"git":{},"filePathRelative":"documentation/admin-news.md"}')}}]);